OL,3,GNEWSAHeavy rain warning as Storm Austen
OL,4,Asweeps across Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland is braced for a wet and windy
OL,7,Fweekend as two named storms hit in two
OL,8,Fdays.
OL,10,FStorm Austen is the first to sweep
OL,11,Facross the country, with the Met Office
OL,12,Fissuing a a yellow warning for rain in
OL,13,Fcentral and eastern areas from 06:00 on
OL,14,FFriday until midnight.
OL,16,FForecasters say some places could
OL,17,Fexperience 60-80mm of rain, with a risk
OL,18,Fof flooding and travel disruption.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
