OL,3,GNEWSAHeavy rain warning as Storm Austen
OL,4,Asweeps across Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorm Boelo will follow hard on its
OL,7,Fheels on Saturday, with another yellow
OL,8,Fweather warning issued, this time for
OL,9,Fhigh winds, for the whole of mainland
OL,10,FScotland, the Western Isles and Orkney.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
